          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceType": "reddit",
          "statement": "玩家反馈，无回复地图加上法力消耗会让他们同时失去伤害与缓冲，印证了双重风险。",
          "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/PathOfExile2/"
        },
        {
          "context": "独特词缀",
          "label": "论坛 - Rathpith 词缀",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceType": "forum",
          "statement": "问题：哪条 Rathpith 是腐化额外。共识是基础「法力转法术伤害」为必需；额外腐化线是奢华。",
          "url": "https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3975218"
        },
        {
          "context": "偏脆",
          "label": "攻略评论 - 防御",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
